I go into the large sports hall.
It is very bright and quite loud here.
Many people are already on the courts.
They run fast and jump high.
I hold the racket firmly in my hand.
I watch for a few minutes.
The players can play really well.
They are very fast.
I really like watching.
But I want to play myself now.
I walk to an empty court.
There I stand at the edge.
I move the racket a little.
I want to finally start.
Can I perhaps join in here?
I hope so very much.
I simply wait next to the court.
Maybe a group wants one more player.
